    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "THANK YOU for your interest in Pan\nAmerican's menu covers. We are pleased that you asked\nfor the complete set and are happy to send them to you.\nMany people find that they are beautiful framed; others\nkeep them among their \"souvenirs\" as attractive mementos\nof a pleasant journey. Whatever your use, we hope you'll\nenjoy having them, and that we may have the pleasure of\nserving you in the future on a Pan American Clipper flight.\nSincerely yours,\nService Manager",
